{"blocks":[["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-5920","Person/Andrew Huberman",["Video","01:51 Exercise/Body/Strength/Face Pull","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-5954","02:29 Again, we've said millions of times, and forgive me for being so repetitive, but external rotation-- this is internal rotation, thumbs pointing towards the midline, belly button.",["01:51 Exercise/Body/Strength/Face Pull","Transcript","Person/Andrew Huberman"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-6167","02:37 This is external rotation, pointing away.",["01:51 Exercise/Body/Strength/Face Pull","Transcript","Person/Andrew Huberman"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-6243","Jeff Cavaliere",["Video","01:51 Exercise/Body/Strength/Face Pull","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-6265","02:39 So now we're up in this position there behind you. And if you think about getting them further behind you, you're going to be getting more into external rotation.",["01:51 Exercise/Body/Strength/Face Pull","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","block-66ed3dc6-2ca3-4f3b-975c-34c23b2d61be","02:47 Execution cues and muscles",["Jeff Cavaliere Shows Andrew Huberman the \"Face Pull\" - YouTube","Video"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-6593","Squeeze the shoulder blades together while the thumbs drive back. The rhomboids, traps, rear delts, and rotator cuff all work, which undoes the rounded-forward posture most people default to. Three or four plates on the stack is enough load.",["Jeff Cavaliere Shows Andrew Huberman the \"Face Pull\" - YouTube","Video","02:47 Execution cues and muscles"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-6841","Transcript",["Jeff Cavaliere Shows Andrew Huberman the \"Face Pull\" - YouTube","Video","02:47 Execution cues and muscles"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-6881","Jeff Cavaliere",["Video","02:47 Execution cues and muscles","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-6903","02:47 At the same time, it doesn't have to be an isolated rotator cuff exercise. So when I'm in here, I'm pulling and squeezing with my scapula, trying to pinch them together.",["02:47 Execution cues and muscles","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-7107","02:55 So I'm getting the rhomboids. I'm getting the traps. I can get all those muscles supporting it. And I'm getting the rear delts right. The rear delts, once I get my elbows behind my body, I'm going to really assist this too.",["02:47 Execution cues and muscles","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-7365","Person/Andrew Huberman",["Video","02:47 Execution cues and muscles","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-7399","03:05 And rear delts are great because almost everyone has a default position like this now.",["02:47 Execution cues and muscles","Transcript","Person/Andrew Huberman"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-7520","Jeff Cavaliere",["Video","02:47 Execution cues and muscles","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-7542","03:09 Well, this is like that antidefault position exercise, because it's going to undo a lot of the postural imbalance that we have. So here, thumbs there.",["02:47 Execution cues and muscles","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-7727","03:19 Come up, get to that position there. Again, at the level of the face here, that's where it comes from. Back, open up, and hold.",["02:47 Execution cues and muscles","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-7889","03:28 And again, I'm not just driving with the thumbs. I'm squeezing with the shoulder blades back there too.",["02:47 Execution cues and muscles","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-8027","Person/Andrew Huberman",["Video","02:47 Execution cues and muscles","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-8061","03:33 Got you.",["02:47 Execution cues and muscles","Transcript","Person/Andrew Huberman"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-8104","Jeff Cavaliere",["Video","02:47 Execution cues and muscles","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-8126","03:33 Yep, all that squeezing, thumbs are driving back that way. Rear delts are kicking in because I get to extension. Once the elbow passes midline here, that's rear delt.",["02:47 Execution cues and muscles","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-8327","03:43 You can even feel that two [too] up in the rear delt right there. So all that on top. And again, I've only got maybe three or four plates on this stack, but that's enough to overload these muscles.",["02:47 Execution cues and muscles","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-8563","03:55 They're not the strongest. But when you do that, you can grow those muscles with this exercise.",["02:47 Execution cues and muscles","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","block-d4fcd2c4-5789-4255-9367-5c2687e93826","04:01 Programming frequency and sets",["Jeff Cavaliere Shows Andrew Huberman the \"Face Pull\" - YouTube","Video"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-8828","Up to three times a week, at the end of a workout, taken to failure for hypertrophy. Open the elbows out to 90 degrees.",["Jeff Cavaliere Shows Andrew Huberman the \"Face Pull\" - YouTube","Video","04:01 Programming frequency and sets"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-8954","Transcript",["Jeff Cavaliere Shows Andrew Huberman the \"Face Pull\" - YouTube","Video","04:01 Programming frequency and sets"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-8994","Person/Andrew Huberman",["Video","04:01 Programming frequency and sets","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-9028","04:01 How often should people do these?",["04:01 Programming frequency and sets","Transcript","Person/Andrew Huberman"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-9096","Jeff Cavaliere",["Video","04:01 Programming frequency and sets","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-9118","04:03 I mean, I really tell people they could do it three times a week.",["04:01 Programming frequency and sets","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-9218","Person/Andrew Huberman",["Video","04:01 Programming frequency and sets","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-9252","04:06 Just finish every workout with it.",["04:01 Programming frequency and sets","Transcript","Person/Andrew Huberman"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-9321","Jeff Cavaliere",["Video","04:01 Programming frequency and sets","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-9343","04:07 Well, if you're going to do it that way, yeah, it makes--",["04:01 Programming frequency and sets","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-9435","Person/Andrew Huberman",["Video","04:01 Programming frequency and sets","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-9469","04:09 I train three times a week, or for [four].",["04:01 Programming frequency and sets","Transcript","Person/Andrew Huberman"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-9550","Jeff Cavaliere",["Video","04:01 Programming frequency and sets","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-9572","04:11 Sure. So I mean, you do it at the end of the workout, just as a postural correction exercise, but with the benefits of still going to failure on these two [too].",["04:01 Programming frequency and sets","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-9772","04:20 You can still get the hypertrophy benefits here. So right there, good. Even open a little bit more. Open the angle, right there. Got it. OK. You want that 90.",["04:01 Programming frequency and sets","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-9965","04:31 Perfect. And you can see, you cannot do this with one rope. You just can't get the angle. You're going to be constrained. Right there. It's perfect.",["04:01 Programming frequency and sets","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-10148","Person/Andrew Huberman",["Video","04:01 Programming frequency and sets","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-10182","04:40 Oh, man. You really feel that in the--",["04:01 Programming frequency and sets","Transcript","Person/Andrew Huberman"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-10255","Jeff Cavaliere",["Video","04:01 Programming frequency and sets","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-10277","04:43 Yep.",["04:01 Programming frequency and sets","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","block-3ed9e707-b6dc-4045-8a3a-1bb7d3fa6d17","04:46 Rotator cuff benefits",["Jeff Cavaliere Shows Andrew Huberman the \"Face Pull\" - YouTube","Video"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-10442","Cavaliere counts it as a complete rotator cuff exercise: external rotation through a natural range, at or above shoulder level, and under load only once the arms are rotating out.",["Jeff Cavaliere Shows Andrew Huberman the \"Face Pull\" - YouTube","Video","04:46 Rotator cuff benefits"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-10628","Transcript",["Jeff Cavaliere Shows Andrew Huberman the \"Face Pull\" - YouTube","Video","04:46 Rotator cuff benefits"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-10668","Person/Andrew Huberman",["Video","04:46 Rotator cuff benefits","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-10702","04:46 Do you consider this a complete rotator cuff exercise?",["04:46 Rotator cuff benefits","Transcript","Person/Andrew Huberman"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-10791","Jeff Cavaliere",["Video","04:46 Rotator cuff benefits","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-10813","04:49 I do, yeah. I do, because you're going into external rotation at a comfortable degree. It's not artificial amount. Some people do exercises like those side lying dumbbell raises, and they go way out to the side.",["04:46 Rotator cuff benefits","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-11059","05:01 That's not necessarily natural amounts of external rotation. Plus, it's happening below the shoulder level. Anything I can do external rotation at shoulder level or above is even more functional, especially for, again, my guys or athletes who are up here anyway.",["04:46 Rotator cuff benefits","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-11356","05:13 And even though, because some people will say this, you're slightly internally rotated here, you're not under load. There's no load there. As you get into the exercise, you're already externally rotating against the load.",["04:46 Rotator cuff benefits","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-11612","05:26 So there is no none of that stress.",["04:46 Rotator cuff benefits","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-11682","Person/Andrew Huberman",["Video","04:46 Rotator cuff benefits","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-11716","05:27 Man, that was tough.",["04:46 Rotator cuff benefits","Transcript","Person/Andrew Huberman"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-11771","Jeff Cavaliere",["Video","04:46 Rotator cuff benefits","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-11793","05:29 Yeah. That's definitely the right way to do it.",["04:46 Rotator cuff benefits","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","block-345a4003-c67f-4e1b-bd49-589caaaa6c19","05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed",["Jeff Cavaliere Shows Andrew Huberman the \"Face Pull\" - YouTube","Video"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-12011","An overhand grip starts in internal rotation; use an underhand grip. Pulling straight to the face works the rear delts but skips the rotator cuff. With one rope, the elbows can't reach 90 degrees.",["Jeff Cavaliere Shows Andrew Huberman the \"Face Pull\" - YouTube","Video","05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-12214","Transcript",["Jeff Cavaliere Shows Andrew Huberman the \"Face Pull\" - YouTube","Video","05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-12254","Jeff Cavaliere",["Video","05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-12276","05:34 And again, what people do, two mistakes I'll show. Again, first of all, they'll go overhand. If they go overhand, and you go to pull, you're already internal rotation.",["05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-12478","05:42 You can't get back. So you can't do that. You got to go underhand. The next thing they'll do is, they do this all the time. They think face pull, so they pull their face.",["05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-12683","05:51 But there's really no rotator cuff involvement there. And I think that's one of the best benefits of the exercise, is the rotator cuff on top of the fact-- because, yes, you can get rear delts here, but you're not getting the rotator cuff because you're not getting external rotation.",["05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-13002","06:03 And then, again, if I were to do one rope, here, it's just impossible-- even if I do everything else right, and I'm here, and I pull back to here, I can't get all the way to that 90 degree angle.",["05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-13232","06:14 You want one more?",["05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-13285","Person/Andrew Huberman",["Video","05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-13319","06:15 Sure.",["05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript","Person/Andrew Huberman"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-13359","Jeff Cavaliere",["Video","05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-13381","06:15 All right.",["05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-13426","Person/Andrew Huberman",["Video","05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-13460","06:16 Yeah.",["05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript","Person/Andrew Huberman"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-13500","Jeff Cavaliere",["Video","05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-13522","06:16 Done right. Good. Open it up. Just a little bit more elbow open. Right there. Right there. You feel the difference when it opens a little bit more?",["05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-13704","Person/Andrew Huberman",["Video","05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-13738","06:24 Yeah, I really feel it in the rear delt.",["05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript","Person/Andrew Huberman"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-13813","Jeff Cavaliere",["Video","05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-13835","06:26 Yeah, Yeah.",["05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-13881","Person/Andrew Huberman",["Video","05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-13915","06:26 And I'm feeling it in the internal muscles of the shoulder joint--",["05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript","Person/Andrew Huberman"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-14016","Jeff Cavaliere",["Video","05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-14038","06:30 Yes.",["05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-14077","Person/Andrew Huberman",["Video","05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-14111","06:31 --the entire time.",["05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript","Person/Andrew Huberman"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-14164","Jeff Cavaliere",["Video","05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-14186","06:34 Great.",["05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-14227","Person/Andrew Huberman",["Video","05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-14261","06:36 That's failure.",["05:34 Mistakes demonstrated and fixed","Transcript","Person/Andrew Huberman"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","block-4caaba5c-5d17-4f29-9669-12f081f1e856","06:38 Final tips",["Jeff Cavaliere Shows Andrew Huberman the \"Face Pull\" - YouTube","Video"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-14426","Face pulls teach the tight, stable shoulder blades that benching needs. Two or three sets to failure, two or three times a week at the end of a workout, after one light set to practice the movement.",["Jeff Cavaliere Shows Andrew Huberman the \"Face Pull\" - YouTube","Video","06:38 Final tips"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-14631","Transcript",["Jeff Cavaliere Shows Andrew Huberman the \"Face Pull\" - YouTube","Video","06:38 Final tips"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-14671","Jeff Cavaliere",["Video","06:38 Final tips","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-14693","06:38 Yeah. And the benefits are many. Again, as far as longevity and the types of exercises that do check the boxes of the smaller things that work, those weak links, this is a huge one when it comes to the upper body.",["06:38 Final tips","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-14941","06:52 And any type of benching. We know that benching requires the ability to maintain tight scapula, solid position, stable scapula when you do it.",["06:38 Final tips","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-15118","07:01 This is going to help you to learn how to do that too. So so many benefits that come from this that contribute to all the big exercises. So I love it.",["06:38 Final tips","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-15303","Person/Andrew Huberman",["Video","06:38 Final tips","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-15337","07:09 Two or three times a week at the end of your workout. Two or three sets to failure after a warm up to just make sure the form is dialed in.",["06:38 Final tips","Transcript","Person/Andrew Huberman"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-15511","Jeff Cavaliere",["Video","06:38 Final tips","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-15533","07:16 Yeah. When I start an entirely different function, if I'm doing basically biceps or triceps, a pushing exercise, this is a straight pull.",["06:38 Final tips","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-15705","07:27 I can just maybe start with another one light set, just to make sure that I'm used to that movement pattern. And then I can get right into the weight there.",["06:38 Final tips","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-15896","Person/Andrew Huberman",["Video","06:38 Final tips","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-15930","07:36 Well, I'm hugely grateful to you for all the work you've done over the years. I know I keep--",["06:38 Final tips","Transcript","Person/Andrew Huberman"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-16058","Jeff Cavaliere",["Video","06:38 Final tips","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-16080","07:41 Same here.",["06:38 Final tips","Transcript","Jeff Cavaliere"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-16125","Person/Andrew Huberman",["Video","06:38 Final tips","Transcript"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-16159","07:41 --I keep saying over and over, you taught me so much through your videos. And today, I learned a bunch of small things and big things that even after 30 plus years of training, I've not done, and they've made a tremendous difference.",["06:38 Final tips","Transcript","Person/Andrew Huberman"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-16427","07:54 So I'm very grateful to you, and I know the people listening and watching feel the same. You're the man, Jeff.",["06:38 Final tips","Transcript","Person/Andrew Huberman"]],["Person/Andrew%20Huberman/Book/26/Protocols/YouTube/26/05/Jeff%20Cavaliere%20Shows%20Andrew%20Huberman%20the%20Face%20Pull/","source-block-16572","Jeff Cavalier